# Formatter boundary for this repository.
#
# FlexCell is a Python/ROS 2 project. Nothing here is a JavaScript toolchain and
# no tree below was ever formatted with prettier, so a blanket `prettier --check`
# over Markdown/JSON/YAML reports style drift that nobody introduced and that
# rewriting would destroy real content.
#
# The non-negotiable case is `setup/acceptance/`: it holds frozen evidence whose
# value is byte identity. Episode payloads, batch JSONL and recovery manifests
# are verified by SHA256 in
# `setup/acceptance/e021_native_recovery_20261024/verify_recovery.py` and
# compared against `fixed_smoke_window_20261024/historical_inventory.json`.
# Pretty-printing any of those files changes the digest and silently voids the
# evidence. A formatter must never be allowed to touch an archived artefact.
#
# Documents under `docs/` are hand-wrapped with aligned tables; regrouping them
# would produce whole-file diffs that hide the actual change under review.
setup/
competition/
docs/
.github/

# Pilot experiment records are byte-stable evidence (run outputs, event logs).
# Reformatting would change the bytes a reviewer may hash; keep them raw.
experiments/
